### log in
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luka@example.com",
  "password": "secret"
}

### create a blog as the logged-in user
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "author": "Luka Ong",
  "url": "https://lukaong.com/articles/microservices.html",
  "title": "Microservices"
}

### no token (401)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/no-token",
  "title": "No token"
}

### broken token (401)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

{
  "url": "https://example.com/bad-token",
  "title": "Bad token"
}

### wrong password (401)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luka@example.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### unknown user (401)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "secret"
}
